       'Injured late in the third quarter of the Chiefs'' Week 7 win over the Raiders when he fell to the turf while chasing running back Ashton Jeanty and Raiders tackle Stone Forsythe landed on top of him (flagged for unnecessary roughness). He was helped off by Patrick Mahomes and teammates. The torn ACL in his right knee ended his rookie season.',
